---
description: MR/PR conventional-commit titles. Use when creating/editing MR/PR
alwaysApply: true
---

Every merge request and pull request title must use conventional-commits format
Apply when creating or updating an MR/PR. Never ship a free-form, sentence-case
or ticket-only title (`Fix bug`, `Update docs`, `ABC-123`). This prevents any
squash and merge/rebase flows from landing an invalid commit title.

